sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as Ola (requester, sector 112)
  participant M as Mesh (routers + phones, 10-hop radius)
  participant K as Marek (nearest citizen to the AED, 4 hops away)
  participant C as Chain: Ania, Piotr, Jan (hops 3, 2, 1)
  participant G as Gateway / Authority
  Q->>M: LIFE_CRITICAL "cardiac arrest, AED needed" (signed, top priority)
  M->>M: flood with de-duplication, pre-empt all other classes
  M->>K: request + registered AED record 40 m from Marek
  K->>M: signed acceptance "fetching AED"
  M->>Q: acceptance back along path, ETA shown to Ola
  M->>C: per-hop instruction: "receive from Marek, pass to Piotr", etc.
  K-->>C: AED moves hand to hand along the discovered path
  C-->>Q: AED arrives in about 90 s (staff would take 6 min)
  Q->>M: CLOSE signed by requester, chain and other responders notified
  M->>G: event reaches a gateway when a path exists, dashboard updated
  Note over Q,G: The network routes the message, the crowd routes the object
